msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"This amateur porn star wannabe is a guy most people know as\r\n"
"the Emperor of Hama. Goh Hamazaki, patriarch of the Hamazaki\r\n"
"Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "By Hama, you mean Yokohama, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Yup. After the Snake Flower Triad got pushed out of town in\r\n"
"the conflict three years ago, Hamazaki arrived on the scene\r\n"
"and made it his own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"This guy's a tough nut to crack, though. For some reason he\r\n"
"stayed buddy-buddy with the Chinese mafia whose turf he\r\n"
"snatched."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "The Snake Flower Triad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Mhm. That's not the only thing raising eyebrows, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Turns out, his family's only got ten guys on their books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"I know. You'd think a guy taking on the Snake Flower Triad\r\n"
"on their home field would need at least 500, or even 1,000\r\n"
"boys backing him up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"But he waltzed into town and claimed ownership without ever\r\n"
"even lifting a finger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "How is that possible?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"If I had to guess, I'd say he's been working behind the\r\n"
"scenes with the Chinese mafia. Smuggling illegal goods into\r\n"
"the country for them, laundering their money. You know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Wouldn't be surprised if it turned out they were using him, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "So he's working with the mafia..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Hard to say for sure, but if all this Tojo stuff ties back\r\n"
"to that Okinawa resort deal, I'd bet Hamazaki was first in\r\n"
"line drafting the blueprints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Meaning he and his Chinese hookups are looking for a slice\r\n"
"of the pie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Probably so they can set up a casino there. Either above\r\n"
"board or otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "This is the chairman of the Hakuho Clan. Yoshitaka Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Yoshitaka Mine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"One of those new-money types who's got more than he knows\r\n"
"what to do with. Spends most of his time downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Often seen driving flashy foreign cars. Day in the life of\r\n"
"a young, rich businessman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"From the sounds of it, most of his fortune sprung out of\r\n"
"insider trading, with a little on the side coming from real\r\n"
"estate. The guy's essentially white-collar yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"He's also the one providing the Tojo Clan with practically\r\n"
"all their funding. As I said, he's loaded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Most of that aid's been going to Kanda from the Nishikiyama\r\n"
"Family, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "How does a guy like this end up working with Kanda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"He wasn't, at first. Up until a few years ago, Mine was\r\n"
"little more than your run-of-the-mill venture capitalist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Seems Kanda's the one who convinced him to join up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"With ties like that, it wasn't long 'til Mine was swearing\r\n"
"an oath with Daigo Dojima and the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "So Kanda and Mine are in league, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Nah, Mine's loyal to the sixth chairman. With how beefy his\r\n"
"own ranks have grown lately, he doesn't need Kanda's muscle\r\n"
"anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "If anything I'd say he's distancing himself from Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"This cue ball here is the third patriarch of the Nishikiyama\r\n"
"Family. Guy by the name of Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Nishikiyama..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Yup. Same group of thugs you took down three years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "I don't think I've ever met this one, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Not surprising. He got tossed in jail for two years on\r\n"
"sexual assault charges."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Guys like him only care about two things: babes and brawls.\r\n"
"When Nishikiyama was still heading the family, this chump\r\n"
"would've been the guy who polished his shoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "So how's he end up patriarch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Once he was a free man, he started expanding his share of\r\n"
"the turf in Kamurocho. Mostly by brute force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Would've been two years back, right after all that business with Ryuji Goda "
"and the Omi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Guy came onto the scene right as the police started backing\r\n"
"off from the Tojo. Perfect timing, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Wasn't long until he'd snapped up practically all the Kazama\r\n"
"Family's territory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "And what's he after?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Tojo chairmanship, if I had to guess. He won't be giving up\r\n"
"on that dream without a fight, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Women, land... He'll stop at nothing to get what he wants.\r\n"
"It's all about power with this guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Then... is it possible he's the one who shot Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Chances are high, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Who's next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "So, where do you wanna start?"
msgstr ""

